#ASSERT `s19(1) a reference to a unit by number is construed as a reference to the unit` VicPart TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST VicInThePartOfTheChapterInWhichTheReferenceOccurs
#ASSERT `s19(1) a reference to a unit by number is construed as a reference to the unit` VicPart TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST VicInThePartOfTheActInWhichTheReferenceOccurs
#ASSERT `s19(1) a reference to a unit by number is construed as a reference to the unit` VicPart FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST VicInThePartOfTheActInWhichTheReferenceOccurs
