#ASSERT `s19(1) a reference to a unit by number is construed as a reference to the unit` VicSubdivision FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST VicInTheSubdivisionOfTheDivisionInWhichTheReferenceOccurs
#ASSERT `s19(1) a reference to a unit by number is construed as a reference to the unit` VicSubsection FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST VicInTheSubsectionOfTheSectionInWhichTheReferenceOccurs
#ASSERT `s19(1) a reference to a unit by number is construed as a reference to the unit` VicParagraphOfASectionSubsectionInterpretationOrSchedule FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST VicInTheParagraphOfTheSectionSubsectionInterpretationOrScheduleInWhichTheReferenceOccurs
#ASSERT `s19(1) a reference to a unit by number is construed as a reference to the unit` VicParagraphOfAClauseSubclauseItemColumnTableOrFormInASchedule FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST VicInTheParagraphOfTheClauseSubclauseItemColumnTableOrFormOfOrInTheScheduleInWhichTheReferenceOccurs
